        372.42730712890625,
        369.5632019042969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To further demonstrate the effectiveness of MBD in high-dimensional systems, we apply MBD to",
      "bbox": [
        107.69100189208984,
        381.1793518066406,
        504.0033264160156,
        390.0859069824219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "optimize an MLP network for MNIST classification [2] without access to the gradient information.",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        392.0883483886719,
        505.74774169921875,
        400.9949035644531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "MBD achieve 85.5% accuracy with 256 samples within 2s, which is comparable to the performance",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        402.2800598144531,
        504.0036315917969,
        412.24267578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of the SGD optimizer with momentum (92.7% accuracy). We use MLP with 2 hidden layers, each",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        413.1890563964844,
        503.9969787597656,
        423.15167236328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "with 32 neurons, and ReLU activation function. The input is flattened to 784 dimensions, and the",
      "bbox": [
        107.64099884033203,
        424.0980529785156,
        503.9997253417969,
        434.0606689453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "output is a 10-dimensional vector. We use cross-entropy loss as the objective function. The network",
      "bbox": [
