        435.008056640625,
        504.24505615234375,
        444.9706726074219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "has 27,562 parameters in total, which makes sampling-based optimization challenging. MBD can",
      "bbox": [
